==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Dugtrio}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Alolan Dugtrio|123}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*{{m|Iron Head}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Dugtrio can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

